---
---

<section id="philosophy" class="philosophy" data-telemetry-section="philosophy">
  <div class="container-site">
    <div class="philosophy__header font-mono">
      <span class="philosophy__tag">01 // CORE PHILOSOPHY</span>
      <span class="philosophy__status">DISCIPLINE::ADVERSARIAL_FIRST</span>
    </div>

    <blockquote class="philosophy__quote font-display">
      <span class="philosophy__sentence philosophy__sentence--lead" data-philosophy-sentence
        >Most software is built to work.</span
      >
      <span class="philosophy__sentence" data-philosophy-sentence
        >Less of it is built to survive someone trying to make it fail: a malformed request, a
        race condition, an attacker who read the same documentation you did.</span
      >
      <span class="philosophy__sentence" data-philosophy-sentence
        >That distinction shapes how I build: web platforms engineered for the team that
        maintains them after I'm gone, and security tooling built for the assessor who needs
        results they can trust in a report.</span
      >
      <span class="philosophy__sentence" data-philosophy-sentence
        >Web2 or Web3, the discipline doesn't change: authorized, documented, reproducible.</span
      >
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import { initPhilosophyReveal } from '../../scripts/philosophy-reveal';

  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', () => initPhilosophyReveal());
</script>

<style>
  .philosophy {
    position: relative;
    padding-block: var(--spacing-section);
  }

  .philosophy__header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    max-width: min(90vw, 680px);
    margin-inline: auto;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .philosophy__tag {
    color: var(--color-accent-phosphor);
  }

  .philosophy__status {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    opacity: 0.75;
  }

  .philosophy__quote {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
    max-width: min(90vw, 680px);
    margin-inline: auto;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .philosophy__sentence {
    display: block;
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 2.125rem);
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    will-change: opacity, filter, transform;
  }

  .philosophy__sentence--lead {
    color: var(--color-accent-phosphor);
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .philosophy__sentence--lead::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.35em;
    width: 0.75rem;
    height: 2px;
    background-color: var(--color-accent-phosphor);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--color-accent-phosphor);
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .philosophy__header {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.35rem;
    }
  }
</style>
